OL,3,AFifth of kids in care at least 20 miles
OL,4,Afrom home
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout a fifth of children in care in
OL,7,FEngland are living more than 20 miles
OL,8,Ffrom home, according to new data, with
OL,9,Fa charity warning it can have a
OL,10,F"devastating impact".
OL,12,FGovernment figures show that of the
OL,13,F82,910 children in care on 31 March,
OL,14,F18,600 were in placements more than 20
OL,15,Fmiles away. This number has increased
OL,16,Fsteadily over the past five years, from
OL,17,F17,030 in 2022.
OL,19,FThe care charity Become warned that
OL,20,Fbeing sent far from home had multiple
OL,21,Fnegative impacts on a child, including
OL,22,Fisolation.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
