OL,3,AFifth of kids in care at least 20 miles
OL,4,Afrom home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said it was creating
OL,7,F10,000 additional foster care places
OL,8,Fand investing #560m to keep more
OL,9,Fchildren close to home.
